README for eval folder

May2021: The subfolder
			"TaylorLagrange"
	contains the code and data used in our ISSAC 2021 paper,

		"Novel Range Functions via Taylor Expansions and Recursive
		 Lagrange Interpolation with Application to Real Root Isolation"
			by
		K.Hormann, L.Kania and C.Yap.
	
	You should be able to reproduce our results using
	the Makefile targets.



